​REPEAT  
​Concept: Run the enclosed blocks N times — one press, many cycles.  
​Job 09 onward: for i in range(10):  
​IF .. ELSE  
​Concept: Test a condition, take one of two paths. Accept or reject.  
​Job 09 onward: if dia <= limit: ... else: ...  
​SENSING  
​Concept: Ask the world a question: touching? key pressed? value of...?  
​Job 08 onward: input() and comparisons  
​VARIABLE  
​Concept: A labelled bin that holds one value — a counter, a score, a diameter.  
​Job 07 onward: count = 0  
